# Seeded from RichardvZyl/engineering-standards, then owned by this repo.
# NOT vendored: Sync-Standards.ps1 writes only inside standards/ (guarantee 1), and
# Test-StandardsIntegrity.ps1 only enforces the read-only header on files under standards/.
# Edits here are safe and will not be overwritten by a standards sync.

## Private context — never committed, in any repo, ever.
## Test-NoProprietaryLeak.ps1 fails the build if one of these is tracked anyway.
*.private.md
*.private.json
secrets/
.env
.env.*
!.env.example
appsettings.*.Local.json

